Files not distributed
---------------------
Sony firmware, audio/radio libraries, Arm's proprietary Mali userspace driver,
pairing databases, device backups and private signing keys are not included.
The builder supplies proprietary inputs locally and must observe their own
licence terms. Arm's driver terms depend on the selected package. The current
graphics adapter is designed to use the driver's original binary; the builder
must not redistribute proprietary images without the applicable rights.
See https://developer.arm.com/Downloads/-/Mali%20GPUs%20User-Space%20Binary%20Drivers
